# Allowlist: only what the website serves goes into the build context.
*
!Dockerfile
!nginx/
!index.html
!my_card_planner.html
!robots.txt
!cards/image-sources.js
!cards/thumbs/
!cards/energy/*.png
!cards/mini/*.png
# Classic-only cards. Shared Classic cards are byte-identical to the Energy
# copies and the planner always loads the Energy files.
!cards/classic/kpdh01-cr-*.png
!cards/classic/kpdh01-zr-*.png
!cards/classic/kpdh01-r-*.png
# Local scans for cards without bundled art.
!cards/promo/*.png
!cards/promo/*.jpg
!cards/*/*.jpg
